<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-28T18:58:20.319Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:58:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen killed seven civilians in a Plateau community and shot Islamic cleric Yahaya Masussuka dead in Katsina state, while bandits attacked APC supporters ahead of a rally in Katsina. In Taraba state, gunmen killed at least 62 people in Binnari, prompting thousands to flee, and in Kaduna, kidnappers abducted six residents from the Millennium City estate. The Nigerian Correctional Service reported that armed escorts fired warning shots during an attack in Rivers that left one dead. A convoy crash in Niger state killed four students and a driver. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNaTZHekRTSzFOQThfNS00SWJLT1hjNlRPdHIzTl9KbWh1b1lkR1dYcTBhZXdfSloyZERTX2ZMV1ZmZXpXZW5qZE95bXRqOGIwSDBPTzdldXBqYS14eWhwWFhUdzUwLWNiRDNvenZXb0F2UWJVMXNnMVJYb2JXeFc2dzl6VEQ4a3VRcTBnUURB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE83bEJFN3QwcG93Mkh5dDJ4SVdKWFRHZkxTZmtlZ0dHb0N3V1BFTzFBdTB3aGYyRHNVUHVRSm1OZjNwc0swVWFhNFJ0N0JOV3FJLUZzdWVySk9WWEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBPeXVzUlRTUkp1QjItMjlzRGJYU1hmMmMtd3ROX1ZTUXFZZkRxVnVpUlU5dXlPRmRZem9BVFZPTm9SSzFfWGYyTlNvMXpWcjVCUTFnZGtyajNvZDBHRGfSAWNBVV95cUxPU3YzTV92alZ0UERRbVk4c2drM2J6X05GN0NjVFFGMmRKZmxGbDZEN1BWLWlnSEF1eW1kamF2TjJzcEJMbTRMSF9CcTVSTDRVbkYzU2VlTmJFWHI3QjR0b3lUdEU?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQX1JtUGNpZC1PRjZyaHZsdHZDQlYtRWpRWXRYT2lDQUlsaVpzelFOYkVvX09CS2xDcVhRS05mMWlkYXYzVFY5ZW5rZk9wTWZZQ3BMYlMzVXQ1U01ESExqWGNQcWRuMVdSQlk4SEJuUGVQa2FnUnV0dWI4UU01RWZZU0xZclpqWDVoRFFybGhUX19yTmRrLU50TXZoUmk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.